send "printf '\\033[3J\\033[H\\033[2J'; for i in {1..120}; do printf 'ROW-%03d alpha ALPHA Beta abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\\n' $i; done; sleep 120\r"
sleep 200ms
sleep 400ms
send "\u0014["
sleep 200ms
send "/alpha\r"
sleep 200ms
screen @OUT@/searched.txt
cells @OUT@/searched.json
resize 100 45
sleep 400ms
screen @OUT@/resized.txt
cells @OUT@/resized.json
send "n"
sleep 200ms
screen @OUT@/repeated.txt
cells @OUT@/repeated.json
kill
